  "description": "As the only daughter of Count Grave, Abella has been pampered and permitted to be as wild as she pleases. Now, she’s ready to channel her reckless charm into winning over Claude, her loyal but infuriatingly proper knight. With a glint in her eye and mischief on her tongue, Abella unleashes a series of salacious demands that are completely improper but undeniably tempting. Claude has always adhered to his lady's whims, so will her sultry orders finally unravel his sense of propriety?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Geumdan Danpyeonseon (금단(禁斷) 단편선) Collection.*",
